      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n의뢰인의 말을 떠올렸다...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“불온한 녀석들을 혼내 주시려면\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>밤<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>대파<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>를 지닌 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>파오리 1마리<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>만을 데리고<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>루주 7번지<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에 있는 골목에 가 주세요.”",
      "escapedControlUnits": 34,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대파를 휘두르는 솜씨가 제법이더군...\n파오리끼리 실력을 겨뤄 보지 않겠나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300D30CB97C0020D718B450B974B2940020C19CC528AC000020C81CBC95C774B354AD70002E002E002E000AD30CC624B9ACB07CB9AC0020C2E4B825C7440020ACA8B9040020BCF4C9C00020C54AACA0B098002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아닛!? 그 커다란 파는...!\n가라르 파오리!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2DB0021003F0020ADF80020CEE4B2E4B7800020D30CB294002E002E002E0021000AAC00B77CB9740020D30CC624B9AC0021003F00100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꾸왁!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AFB8C64100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
