      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그를 쓰러뜨리다니,\n상당한 실력자로군.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B97C0020C4F0B7ECB728B9ACB2E4B2C8002C000AC0C1B2F9D55C0020C2E4B825C790B85CAD70002E00100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 늙은이와도\n진검승부를 겨뤄 주지 않겠나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020B299C740C774C640B3C4000AC9C4AC80C2B9BD80B97C0020ACA8B9040020C8FCC9C00020C54AACA0B098002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "동지의 패배는 나의 패배나 마찬가지!\n그의 설욕을 대신해 주겠다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3D9C9C0C7580020D328BC30B2940020B098C7580020D328BC30B0980020B9C8CC2CAC00C9C00021000AADF8C7580020C124C695C7440020B300C2E0D5740020C8FCACA0B2E4002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 잠깐...!\n가라르 파오리라고!?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n크윽... 그래도 싸우는 수밖에!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
