      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020BA4BC9C40020C2B9BD80C600C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "죄송해요. 사실 저희는\n영화 ‘3인의 대파’의 팬이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8C4C1A1D574C694002E0020C0ACC2E40020C800D76CB294000AC601D654002020180033C778C7580020B300D30C2019C7580020D32CC774C5D0C694002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "영화와 같은 시추에이션에서\n포켓몬 승부를 하는 게 꿈이었어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C601D654C6400020AC19C7400020C2DCCD94C5D0C774C158C5D0C11C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558B2940020AC8C0020AFC8C774C5C8C5B4C694002E00100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러기 위해서는 우리를 대적할 만한 실력의\n파오리와 트레이너가 필요했죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECAE300020C704D574C11CB2940020C6B0B9ACB97C0020B300C801D5600020B9CCD55C0020C2E4B825C758000AD30CC624B9ACC6400020D2B8B808C774B108AC000020D544C694D588C8E0002E00100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 마침 당신을 만나서\n골목으로 오게 한 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020B9C8CE680020B2F9C2E0C7440020B9CCB098C11C000AACE8BAA9C73CB85C0020C624AC8C0020D55C0020AC70C608C694002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "서스펜스를 연출하기 위해\n자세한 이야기는 생략했지만요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C11CC2A4D39CC2A4B97C0020C5F0CD9CD558AE300020C704D574000AC790C138D55C0020C774C57CAE30B2940020C0DDB7B5D588C9C0B9CCC694002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "속인 것에 대해서는\n뭐라 드릴 말씀이 없습니다...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C18DC7780020AC83C5D00020B300D574C11CB294000ABB50B77C0020B4DCB9B40020B9D0C500C7740020C5C6C2B5B2C8B2E4002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 도움을 주셔서\n정말 감사합니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020B3C4C6C0C7440020C8FCC154C11C000AC815B9D00020AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E4002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "크으~ 따라 해 보고 싶었던 그 대사...\n드디어 실제로 써먹어 봤네요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D06CC73C007E0020B530B77C0020D5740020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5C8B3580020ADF80020B300C0AC002E002E002E000AB4DCB514C5B40020C2E4C81CB85C0020C368BA39C5B40020BD24B124C694002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파오리들도 아주 몰입해서 싸우더군요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CC624B9ACB4E4B3C40020C544C8FC0020BAB0C785D574C11C0020C2F8C6B0B354AD70C694002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꾸왁! 꾸~왁! 꾸와악!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AFB8C64100210020AFB8007EC64100210020AFB8C640C545002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 이만 실례하지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
